// Sleep: shared HP-pool AoE incapacitation, not a per-target resist roll.
// `pooled_debuff.pool` is a first-pass PLACEHOLDER (30.0) -- roughly enough
// to catch 2-3 low-HP mobs or one moderately hurt one, in the spirit of
// D&D 5e's 5d8 (~22.5 average) pool at a comparable early level, nudged up
// slightly since targets here are sorted/resolved deterministically rather
// than rolled. Tune once real mob HP bands are measured against it.
//
// `damage`/`poise`/`knockback`/`dodgeable` below are unused when
// `pooled_debuff` is set (see `CharacterAbility::GroundAoe`'s doc comment)
// -- kept at 0/no-op rather than removed from the RON shape.
//
// energy_cost anchored to sibling level-1 Enchantment/Arcane debuff spells:
// faerie_fire (45) and hideous_laughter (45, also grants Asleep) sit at 45,
// bane at 60; 50 splits the difference, a little above a single-target
// debuff since this is a full-incapacitation AoE, well below the raw-damage
// GroundAoe nukes (83-225).
//
// Asleep's `dur_secs: 60` mirrors hideous_laughter's own Asleep grant (also
// 60s) -- wake-on-damage removal is already wired for `Asleep` generically,
// so this is just the "sleeps until disturbed, capped at a minute" ceiling.
GroundAoe(
    energy_cost: 50.0,
    buildup_duration: 0.6,
    delay: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.4,
    max_range: 27.0,
    radius: 6.0,
    min_falloff: 0.4,
    damage: 0.0,
    poise: 0.0,
    knockback: (strength: 0.0, direction: Away),
    dodgeable: No,
    reagent: None,
    rooted_cast: false,
    pooled_debuff: Some((
        pool: 30.0,
        buff: (
            kind: Asleep,
            dur_secs: 60,
            strength: Value(1.0),
            chance: 1.0,
        ),
    )),
    meta: (
        school: Some(Enchantment),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 1 spell -> min_level 6, the `level * 6` convention (see
        // see_invisibility.ron).
        requirements: (min_level: Some(6)),
    ),
)
